\par
\b 5. Security Already In Place\b0\par
- Row Level Security enabled on core tables.\par
- FORCE RLS enabled on core tables.\par
- Profiles restricted by same sport.\par
- Trials and offers restricted to coach-owned content and matching sport.\par
- Contact requests restricted to matching sport and player/coach pairs only.\par
- Profile role and sport cannot be changed after registration.\par
- Duplicate direct conversations are blocked.\par
- Same-role conversations are blocked.\par
- Messages are only visible to conversation members.\par
- Senders cannot mark their own messages as read.\par
- Empty messages are blocked.\par
- Accepted or declined requests cannot be changed again.\par
\par
